It made these changes outside the training code:
- added a load_preset helper so saved presets load on newer torch, and used it in the watch code and tests;
- fixed DuplicateEnvironment.close and GymEnvironment.seed;
- made the --fps and --save_freq arguments parse as integers;
- made ExperimentLogger.close flush the TensorBoard writer;
- rewrote the seed-dependent softmax and parallel-experiment tests to assert invariants;
- fixed two ParallelEnvExperiment measurement bugs: the episode-length undercount with GymVectorEnvironment and biased test-episode selection when n_envs exceeds the number of test episodes.
The last two directly change the logged training/test metrics the user reports.

It changed:
- the logger: metric aliasing, aggregation and writer flush/close;
- `check_nan`, which now also rejects infinities and handles nested observations;
- code-state provenance snapshots;
- the W&B/Neptune config handling and shutdown;
- runner exception-safe cleanup, plus docs and many tests.

The logging fixes can change the logged episode metrics the user reports, and the stricter `check_nan` can halt training runs that previously continued.
